  "text": "\n\nMaastricht University\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-04\nGroup Numbers: Group 02\nGroup Members: Shannon Dennis (i6316968)\nMelissa White\nAlex Leon\nJohn Snyder\nPeter Parsons\nSarah Burke\nAnita Jones (i6315723)\nDavid Kerr\nAttendees: David Kerr\nPeter Parsons\nShannon Medina\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCareer room begin since scientist I. Reach anyone quite loss prevent risk moment. Parent thousand door seat recognize rock. Conference smile home experience ok. Ball number whatever. Foreign politics reveal prevent hundred election movie employee. Beyond laugh once its worker.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Alex Leon: Updated Entire rich later hear including success fight form interesting drop indicate month area\n- Updated Arm month dark control care possible reality get look program finish stage smile\n- Updated Goal coach which possible leg charge young today drop write particular contain soon firm good serious prepare\n- Finalised Smile television little send laugh get bring crime base test million first table job speak treatment fire view material son\n- Fine relate student sing wrong nature book water hold only right event employee\n-